cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Polymathic Learner: a visual learning archive"
message: "If you refer to this archive or any document within it, please cite it as below."
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-30
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23054957
abstract: >-
  A collection of twenty-four self-contained interactive HTML documents in which
  mathematical, geometric and speculative ideas are given manipulable form. Includes
  the 易 (Yi) sequence: a historical prelude on the inheritance of 阴阳, 五行 and 八卦 in
  Chinese cultural memory, three parts reconstructing the I Ching's notation as a
  continuous dynamical state space, and three interactive geometric instruments.
